  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Three types of particles that might be emitted during radioactive decay are <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma\"></span> particles. Which of the following correctly lists these particles in decreasing ionizing power?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\gamma\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\beta\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
